---
description: >-
  Bottom-to-top lanes: the title band stays on top of each lane, as for TB
  (D536). Three lanes, a group nested in the first, a loose node in the
  default lane, and a lane title longer than its one node is wide, which
  the lane grows to hold.
---
swimlane-beta BT
  subgraph L1[Sales]
    subgraph G1[Intake]
      A[Receive order] --> B[Check stock]
    end
    C[Confirm]
  end
  subgraph L2[Warehouse and dispatch, second shift]
    D[Pick]
  end
  subgraph L3[Billing]
    E[Invoice] --> F[Collect]
  end
  B --> C --> D --> E
  Start --> A
